          "Unpaid Loan [Total Amount of Loan + 10% interest per week unpaid] - Max Level escalation Level 6",
          "Factions with bad management that take out insane loans can be penalized for the amount they owe plus interest via an alliance enforced tax. Should they fail to pay after several weeks the opposing faction may have the right to PK the person who took the loan. (Requires close observation from UA)",
